    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience university life, love, and strife! </strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232710/extras/5421aa70c78e49e79f7077c2f7a6ddf9.avif?t=1748672105\" width=600 height=300 /></span> <br>Starting university with a major heartache, Noah miraculously meets a tomboy classmate, gorgeous doctor, and junior-year goth all in one day. He soon finds pursuing the love story he wants won't be easy, especially when his cute best friend decides to interfere!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Every scene is individually drawn! </li><li> All shown characters are fully voiced! </li><li> Explores an American university setting! </li><li> Each romantic interest is an entirely separate experience! </li><li> It's forever and ever a free game! </li><li> The community fuels the story's development! </li><li> Includes an extensive teaser of what's to come next! </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The cutest childhood best friend \ud83e\ude77</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232710/extras/4eb2e58c613559799ec58be05ba2b3bd.avif?t=1748672105\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The most awesomest tomboy \u2b50</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232710/extras/f678496a912d1b45cab5e41e228ba64c.avif?t=1748672105\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The scandalously stunning doctor \ud83c\udf77</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232710/extras/5918f016ee6ba2cb540890b77ec69f7d.avif?t=1748672105\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" 